      "message": "<pre><p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=1254342\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/11/ad11e0117c87122a.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><div class=\"spoiler_control\"><input class=\"spoiler_btn\" type=\"button\" value=\"特别提醒与专属奖励发放规则\" onclick=\"n=this.parentNode.parentNode.lastChild;n.style.display=(n.style.display=='none'?'block':'none');return false;\"/></div><div class=\"spoiler_content\" style=\" display: none;\"><div class=\"showhide\">参与CP表演赛<font color=\"red\">任一轮</font>即可获得惠惠勋章（30天）<img src=\"img01/medal///4月/萌战冬季冠军.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />参与CP表演赛<font color=\"red\"><strong>全过程</strong></font>可获得至少<font color=\"#ff4775\">150ww 300tsb</font>参与CP表演赛<font color=\"red\"><strong>全过程并登记</strong></font>可额外获得<font color=\"#ff4775\">50ww 100tsb+10xc+1能量值+10萌战投票积分+天使动漫萌战专属发帖背景木之本樱</font><font color=\"red\"><全过程=所有投票帖均按要求投票+回帖晒票，所有结果帖均按要求回帖></font>签名挂上萌战总帖链接参赛可得<font color=\"#ff4775\">xc奖励</font>文字宣传<div class=\"blockcode\"><div></div><div id=\"code_code_QNE\"><ol><li>[url=forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1254342]2025天使动漫萌战 CP表演赛[/url]</li></ol></div><em>复制代码</em></div>图片宣传<div class=\"blockcode\"><div></div><div id=\"code_code_9E9\"><ol><li>[url=https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1254342][img=600,400]https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/11/fb7df2d80d5c56b5.png[/img][/url]</li></ol></div><em>复制代码</em></div><font color=\"red\">***奖励最高可获得<strong>240ww 440tsb 40xc+天使动漫萌战专属发帖背景木之本樱+10萌战投票积分</strong>，详情请见<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=1254352\" target=\"_blank\">参与纪录登记处</a></font><font color=\"red\"><strong>注：</strong></font>1.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到2能量值</font>可兑换黑兔勋章 （90天）<img src=\"img01/medal///7月/萌战黑兔.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><font color=\"red\"><兑换需消耗能量值></font>2.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到4能量值</font>可兑换<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/img01/postbg/moe2017.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">立华奏背景（365天）</a><font color=\"red\"><兑换需消耗能量值></font>3.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到6能量值且近一个月内完整参与萌战季节篇/完结篇</font>可兑换<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/img01/postbg/tsmwysn.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">光环-亚丝娜背景（365天）</a>或<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/img01/postbg/tsmyxy.JPG\" target=\"_blank\">羽翼-小樱背景（365天）</a><font color=\"red\"><兑换需消耗能量值></font>4.<font color=\"darkorchid\">达到100萌战总积分</font>可获得萌战荣耀纪念勋章（永久）<img src=\"img01/medal///7月/萌战荣耀.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />5.<font color=\"darkorchid\">每达到50萌战投票积分</font>可领取一只萌战专属宠物（永久）<font color=\"red\"><兑换不消耗积分></font><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20151.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20161.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20171.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20181.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20191.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"Pokemon/pm/20201.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"https://img.tsdm39.com/Pokemon/pm/20211.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />6.<font color=\"darkorchid\">萌战总积分233分以上</font>，且在本版块至少发表1个五萌系列的<font color=\"red\">优秀帖</font>可获得永久第二称号牌：宝多六花<img src=\"img01/title/宝多六花.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><font color=\"red\">更多奖励兑换说明详见：</font><a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=852509&fromuid=1202448\" target=\"_blank\">【积分／勋章／背景／宠物／牌子申请贴】2L积分统计</a></div></div></div><hr class=\"l\" /><p align=\"center\"><font size=\"5\"><font style=\"background-color:Purple\"><font color=\"White\"><strong>晋级本次CP表演赛半决赛的角色</strong></font></font></font></p><table><tr style=\"background-color:#5599FF\"><td colspan=\"10\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#0000FF\"><strong><p align=\"center\">复赛A组</p></strong></font></font></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/99c37d7b17929b56.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/5ef22b1340305ede.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><font color=\"Red\"><strong><p align=\"center\">No.1：76票</p></strong></font></td><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><font color=\"Red\"><strong><p align=\"center\">No.2：71票</p></strong></font></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/124c3a8419329af2.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><font color=\"Red\"><strong><p align=\"center\">No.3：34票</p></strong></font></td></tr></table><table><tr style=\"background-color:#5599FF\"><td colspan=\"10\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#0000FF\"><strong><p align=\"center\">复赛B组</p></strong></font></font></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/721508258e2eb1a1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/1d6883da93657de1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><font color=\"Red\"><strong><p align=\"center\">No.1：65票</p></strong></font></td><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><font color=\"Red\"><strong><p align=\"center\">No.2：52票</p></strong></font></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/ac8d0316735548d7.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><font color=\"Red\"><strong><p align=\"center\">No.3：32票</p></strong></font></td></tr></table><table><tr style=\"background-color:#5599FF\"><td colspan=\"10\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#0000FF\"><strong><p align=\"center\">复赛C组</p></strong></font></font></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" width=\"338\"><p align=\"center\"><img width=\"224\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/37521870d16a0c8c.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></p></td><td colspan=\"3\