arget=\"_blank\">B组</a>、<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=1255213\" target=\"_blank\">C组</a>、<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=1255214\" target=\"_blank\">D组</a>）被淘汰</strong></font></p><p align=\"center\"><font color=\"Red\"><font size=\"5\"><strong>注意：认真回复本帖即可获得威望天使币～</strong></font></font></p><p align=\"center\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"Red\">天使动漫萌战十周年特别活动——回忆征集（12.1~12.31）（<a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=1251000&&fromuid=1202448\" target=\"_blank\">传送门</a>）</font></font><a href=\"https://www.tsdm39.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=1251000&&fromuid=1202448\" target=\"_blank\"><img width=\"224\" height=\"149\" src=\"https://tu.ts-dm.net/imgs/2025/12/a0aaccc5b33ec689.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></p></pre><style>#postlist div:nth-of-type(-n+4) .tsdm_post_t {background: none !important;}#postlist>div:nth-of-type(-n+4) .pstatus,#postlist>div:nth-of-type(-n+4) .pstatus+br,#postlist>div:nth-of-type(-n+4) .pstatus+br+br {display: none !important;}</style><style>pre {margin-top: 0; font-family: initial; white-space: pre-wrap; white-space: -moz-pre-wrap; white-space: -pre-wrap; white-space: -o-pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;}</style>",
